		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Glittering humanoids garbed in ebon robes. Wide, pure white wings. Often appear to those having a crisis of faith.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 mace +3 (1d6) or mark of faith, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Divine Aura</strong>. Hostile spells targeting the angel are DC 15. Mace dissolves if slain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mark of Faith</strong>. 3/day, mark a mortal within near with the glowing holy symbol of the angel's god, lasts 1d4 days. ADV on attacks and hostile spells by god's believers.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
